            "heading_primary_class": "text-20/16-500",
            "paragraph_primary": "<p>Need assistance? Our experts are always ready to help at every step. Whether you have questions about choosing the right deck, assembling your kit, or anything in between, we’re here to make the process smooth and stress-free.</p>",
