        },
        "text_card_KGccTg": {
          "type": "text-card",
          "settings": {
            "title": "<p>[icon.5-stars.20.#FFD773]</p><p></p><p>\"Being in the construction business, I appreciate a well-engineered product. A-DIY's DIY deck is a testament to sound engineering. The assembly process is intuitive, and the deck's modular design is a stroke of genius. It's become a talking point among my colleagues.\"</p><p><br/></p><p><strong>Mathew R.</strong></p>",
            "content_class": "text-20/16-500",
            "url": "",
            "width_height_aspect": "100% | 100% | auto",
