        "text_card_KbYizd": {
          "type": "text-card",
          "settings": {
            "title": "<p>[icon.5-stars.20.#FFD773]</p><p></p><p>\"I'm not the handiest person, but A-DIY's instructions were so clear that I had my deck up in under an hour. The cost was a fraction of what I was quoted by contractors, and the quality is fantastic. My friends are amazed at how quickly I transformed my outdoor space.\"</p><p><br/></p><p><strong>Steve J.</strong></p>",
